[[Image:Brewnall Village.jpg|thumb|300px|Brewnall Village]]
'''Brewnall Village''' is a tiny [[Dwarf|dwarven]] village established in [[Chill Breeze Valley]], near [[Gnomeregan]]. It serves as a home for the [[Barleybrew]]s, who constantly work to experiment and improve on the venerable dwarven beer brewing tradition. The Barleybrews send young dwarves out on missions to protect the village from wild animals<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|8|A Favor for Evershine}}</ref> and seek out secret ingredients for the ultimate ale.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|9|The Perfect Stout}}</ref>

